{
  "uid": "cronusfarm-proto-c-iframe-mock",
  "title": "CronusFarm — 프로토타입 C (iFrame + DB→Influx 패널)",
  "tags": [
    "cronusfarm",
    "prototype",
    "C",
    "iframe",
    "db",
    "influx"
  ],
  "timezone": "Asia/Seoul",
  "refresh": "10s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 4,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "type": "query",
        "name": "zone",
        "label": "Zone",
        "hide": 0,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "influxdb",
          "uid": "efjwqrorrfxtsf"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "query": "import \"influxdata/influxdb/schema\"\n\nschema.tagValues(\n  bucket: \"CronusFarm\",\n  tag: \"zone\",\n  predicate: (r) => r._measurement == \"tele_db\",\n  start: -30d,\n)",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 1,
      "title": "설명",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "이 대시보드는 **원본 HTML**을 Pi에서 웹으로 서빙한 뒤, Grafana에서 **iFrame으로 임베드**하고, 아래에는 **DB 시드 데이터(SQLite) → Influx 미러링** 패널을 함께 배치한 **C 프로토타입**입니다.\\n\\n- iFrame: 원본 UI(사이드바/JS/애니메이션)\\n- Grafana 패널: `device_state`, `device_run`, `alerts`, `schedules` (DB 기반 데이터)\\n- 주의: Grafana 설정에서 임베딩이 막혀 있으면(iFrame/CSP) 빈 화면일 수 있습니다."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 2,
      "title": "CronusFarm HTML (iFrame)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 18
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<div style=\"height:100%; width:100%\">\n  <iframe\n    src=\"http://100.68.249.55:8011/cronusfarm_dashboard.html\"\n    style=\"width:100%; height:100%; border:0; border-radius:10px;\"\n    sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-forms allow-popups\"\n  ></iframe>\n</div>"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 10,
      "title": "🗄️ DB 시드 데이터(Inﬂux 미러링)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "id": 11,
      "title": "장치 상태 타임라인 (device_state)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "efjwqrorrfxtsf"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "efjwqrorrfxtsf"
          },
          "query": "from(bucket: \"CronusFarm\")\n  |> range(start: v.timeRangeStart, stop: v.timeRangeStop)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"device_state\" and r._field == \"value\")\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r.zone =~ /${zone:regex}/)\n  |> aggregateWindow(every: v.windowPeriod, fn: last, createEmpty: false)\n  |> map(fn: (r) => ({ r with _field: r.device }))"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "mergeValues": false,
        "rowHeight": 0.75,
        "fillOpacity": 85,
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#888780",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#1D9E75",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "OFF",
                  "color": "#888780"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "ON",
                  "color": "#1D9E75"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "id": 12,
      "title": "최근 알림 (alerts)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "efjwqrorrfxtsf"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "efjwqrorrfxtsf"
          },
          "query": "from(bucket: \"CronusFarm\")\n  |> range(start: -30d)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"alerts\")\n  |> pivot(rowKey: [\"_time\"], columnKey: [\"_field\"], valueColumn: \"_value\")\n  |> keep(columns: [\"_time\", \"severity\", \"type\", \"source\", \"message\", \"resolved\", \"value_actual\", \"value_threshold\"])\n  |> sort(columns: [\"_time\"], desc: true)\n  |> limit(n: 50)"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "id": 13,
      "title": "스케줄 (schedules)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 39,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "efjwqrorrfxtsf"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "efjwqrorrfxtsf"
          },
          "query": "from(bucket: \"CronusFarm\")\n  |> range(start: -30d)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"schedules\")\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r.zone =~ /${zone:regex}/)\n  |> pivot(rowKey: [\"_time\"], columnKey: [\"_field\"], valueColumn: \"_value\")\n  |> keep(columns: [\"_time\", \"device\", \"type\", \"zone\", \"action\", \"is_active\", \"name\", \"cron\", \"set_value\"])"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
